<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Booking Status Update</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f4f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: #e6f0fc;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header img {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #0d47a1;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .content h2 {
            color: #0d47a1;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .content p {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .status {
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .confirmed {
            background-color: #d4edda;
            color: #155724;
        }

        .cancelled {
            background-color: #f8d7da;
            color: #721c24;
        }

        .completed {
            background-color: #cce5ff;
            color: #004085;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <img src="cid:rezervoLogo" alt="Rezervo Ambientin Logo" />
        <h1>Booking Status Update</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{user.firstName}},</p>

        <p>Your booking status has been updated.</p>

        <div class="status {{status}}">
            <span>New Status: {{status}}</span>
        </div>

        <h2>Booking Details</h2>
        <p><strong>Venue:</strong> {{venue.name.en}}</p>
        <p><strong>Start Date:</strong> {{booking.startDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>End Date:</strong> {{booking.endDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>Start Time:</strong> {{booking.startTime}}</p>
        <p><strong>End Time:</strong> {{booking.endTime}}</p>

        {{#if booking.specialRequests}}
            <h2>Special Requests</h2>
            <p>{{booking.specialRequests}}</p>
        {{/if}}

        <p>If you have any questions or concerns, feel free to reach out to us.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
